akh rupees in  india pwc hcl accent choco forge and  deloitte are some of the top companies  hiring cyber security experts now the  next course we have on our list is the  big data course companies and internet  users across the world are generating  enormous amounts of data every day by  2025 there will be 175 zettabytes of  data collected globally with tremendous  job opportunities and hiring big data  analysts being a top priority in a lot  of organizations a career in big data  would be an ideal choice for you by  enrolling in a big data course you will  learn big data frameworks such as hadoop  and the real-time processing framework  apache spark you will also gain  expertise in nosql based technologies  like mongodb cassandra and hedgebase  apart from these you will also learn  tools such as hive and pig with these  skills you can become a big data  developer big data analyst or a big data  consultant a big data engineer can earn  121 thousand dollars to 251 000 per  annum in the united states  in india he or she can earn close to  12.3 lakh to 33 lakh rupees per annum  with the right certification with big  data skills you can try for companies  such as walmart dell cognizant cisco and  american express coming to the seventh  course in the list of top 10 tech  courses we have blockchain developer  blockchain's popularity grew with the  rise of bitcoin prices as per indeed.com  the success of the cryptocurrency  industry has resulted in 118 jump in  career postings for blockchain jobs  compared to last year by learning  blockchain you'll understand how  blockchain technology works ethereum  solidity hyperledger smart contracts and  learn to build production ready apps you  will understand the blockchain  architecture and what it takes to  implement the individual blockchain  components into a unified system you  will also gain exposure to research and  evaluate new tools and technologies and  integrate them into a blockchain network  a blockchain developer could earn 125  000 to 185 thousand 250 dollars in the  united states and 6 lakh to 14 lakh  rupees per annum in india jp morgan kpmg  microsoft and usd global are a few  companies that are actively hiring  blockchain developers  up next we have the digital marketing  course  digital marketing is a precious asset to  a business's growth both large and small  and helps to establish an absolute  online presence with digital marketers  companies can reach a global audience in  a way that's cost effective scalable and  measurable they can help you monitor  your campaigns and optimize them for  better results and find out what your  competitors are doing online a good  digital marketing course will help you  learn seo scm web analytics social media  marketing content marketing and email  marketing with these skills you can  implement powerful and cost effective  ways to promote your business to its  target audience a digital marketing  manager could earn 60 000 to 160 000 in  the united states and 7 lakh to 16 lakh  rupees per annum in india google zoho  times internet myntra and wipro digital  are actively hiring digital marketing  professionals in the fifth place we have  the very popular python programming  course python is one of the most widely  used programming languages in the iit  industry as of february 2021 python was  the most popular programming language  based on how regularly its tutorials  were searched on google with a 30.06  percent market share the python course  will help you learn the basics of python  programming such as data structures  loops and functions you will understand  the essential object-oriented  programming concepts along with advanced  topics such as file handling modules and  packages python graphical user interface  as well as important libraries like  numpy and pandas after completing this  course you can apply for python  developer web developer data analyst and  data scientist types of job roles a  python developer could earn 109 000 