y showing your  exposure to the data science field and  applying data science to real-life  business cases by choosing the right  certification a data scientist can earn  up to 115 000 to 246 000 in the united  states and 8.2 lakh to 20 lakh rupees in  india gramina uber intel twitter and  paypal are a few companies that you  should consider for a career in data  science  second on the list we have ai and  machine learning courses ai and machine  learning are two of the biggest and most  popular technologies of the 21st century  ai and machine learning have found their  applications in healthcare retail  entertainment e-commerce manufacturing  logistics as well as the aerospace  industry ai and machine learning jobs  are highly in demand and it is the skill  of the century by enrolling in this  course you will be trained in machine  learning algorithms deep learning  artificial neural networks as well as  natural language processing after  gaining all the crucial skills you can  now build smart systems and devices that  can mimic human intelligence an ai  engineer can earn hundred and forty  thousand dollars to three hundred and  eighty six thousand dollars in the  united states and six lakh to 20 lakh  rupees in india  top companies hiring machine learning  and ai engineers are google adobe  qualcomm sprinkler and fidelity  investments  finally at number one in the list of top  10 trending tech courses for 2022 we  have cloud computing between 2020 and  2021 cloud computing erupted as work  went virtual and businesses adapted to  the global pandemic according to  statista.com the worldwide public cloud  computing market is expected to reach an  estimated 482 billion us dollars in  2022. cloud computing professionals not  only improve how businesses store and  access data but are also transforming  how businesses operate a cloud computing  course will walk you through the general  cloud computing concepts and give a  solid foundation of cloud computing  platforms su